  "_comment": "Hand-maintained layer of the HK knowledge graph. Code-level import edges are generated by gen_graph.py. status values: done | partial | storage-only | prototype | legacy | untested-hw | in-progress | not-started. 'plan' lists MASTER_PLAN section numbers. 'paths' are repo-relative files/dirs; gen_graph.py --check fails if one is missing. Keep notes factual; detail belongs in docs/plan/STATUS.md.",
